content.text:
I've updated the vault and committed it as `812ca257b` on `feature/pk-2`. It isn't pushed, and your `social-threads` change is still uncommitted.

- **`04-engineering/tech-context.md`:** adds the Nosto account ID (`shopify-35089973385`) and its status as of 2026-10-05: not set up for the SOW. It lists what we found:
  - still on the free trial;
  - the Search page is a sales page and `/search/templates` returns 403;
  - no API tokens;
  - the multi-currency error;
  - Nosto Admin crashing;
  - none of the search settings in the storefront script.

  It also records the readiness check to run once Nosto replies.
- **`00-overview/timeline.md`:** a new 2026-10-05 row: "Phase 2 Initial Setup (Nosto)… Blocked on Nosto".

The context doc now records that you sent the follow-up in the original Slack thread and will chase Nosto tomorrow morning (`1b17654`).

Where things stand:
- Both repos' work is committed locally on their feature branches, and nothing has been pushed.
- The theme branch is waiting on your OK to push, which opens the auto-PR into `nosto/_candidate`.
- Your dev theme still needs `shopify theme dev` restarted from the worktree, to pick up `nosto-i18n.liquid`.

When Nosto replies, paste their answer here. I'll run the readiness check and, if Search is on, test the full flow on your dev theme.

